<section class="section privacy" data-tint="#1c1b22 #23202b">
  <div class="wrap privacy__inner">
    <p class="privacy__list" role="list">
      <span role="listitem">no tracking.</span>
      <span role="listitem">no analytics.</span>
      <span role="listitem">no data collection.</span>
      <span role="listitem" class="privacy__punch">not ever.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="lede privacy__lede">
      ramus talks to the following: your plex media server (duh), plex.tv to sign in to your account, lrclib when you ask for lyrics, and other players on your
      network if you cast to them. that's the whole list. your plex token is encrypted at rest, and this website doesn't
      track you either.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .privacy__inner {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
  }

  .privacy__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0 0.35em;
    max-width: 16ch;
    font: 700 var(--step-4) / 0.98 var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: "wdth" 92;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }

  .privacy__punch {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .privacy__lede {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
